# Test fetching weather for CEP 01001000
GET http://localhost:8080/clima/01001000
Content-Type: application/json

### Test fetching weather for an invalid CEP
GET http://localhost:8080/clima/11111111
Content-Type: application/json

### Test fetching weather for a valid CEP with invalid format
GET http://localhost:8080/clima/01.001-000
Content-Type: application/json